    'Safety-critical flags that fire independently of the four axes, with priority and a suggested action for the reporting / referring team.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN nerve_conduction_study_test_result_grade_flag.id IS
    'Primary key UUID, auto-generated.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN nerve_conduction_study_test_result_grade_flag.created_at IS
    'Timestamp when this row was created.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN nerve_conduction_study_test_result_grade_flag.updated_at IS
    'Timestamp when the record was updated most-recently.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN nerve_conduction_study_test_result_grade_flag.deleted_at IS
    'Timestamp when the record was deleted a.k.a. soft-removed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN nerve_conduction_study_test_result_grade_flag.nerve_conduction_study_test_result_grade_id IS
    'Foreign key to the parent grade.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN nerve_conduction_study_test_result_grade_flag.flag_id IS
    'Stable flag identifier (e.g. F-CRITICAL-RESULT-001).';
